sn't the same dude from the prequels? That'd be awesome!<br /> <br /> Oh!! What if they did something like The Princess Bride and the Dread Pirates Roberts? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Hmm...wasn't there a whole tradition among ancient Mandalorians of their leader always assuming the identity of Mandalore? I seem to recall at least one case in which this happens after a dude recovers the lost helmet of a previous Mandalore. Sort of fits that the Boba Fett, the &quot;last of the Mandalorians&quot; would become an &quot;inherited&quot; name as well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>You need a picture altered to fit your Exalted character, or just looking for some visual inspiration? Check out the twice-reborn <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/266-photoshop-exaltification\" target=\"_blank\"> Exaltification thread</a>. And here is my <a href=\"http://danelsan.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Deviantart page</a><br /> <br /> S\u00f8ren Kierkegaard + Kim Kardashian = <a href=\"https://twitter.com/KimKierkegaard\" target=\"_blank\">Brilliance</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/868-danelsan","name":"danelsan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar868_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-20T10:59:24-08:00","id":54088,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>danelsan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/2645-star-wars-new-movies?p=54076#post54076\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Hmm...wasn't there a whole tradition among ancient Mandalorians of their leader always assuming the identity of Mandalore? I seem to recall at least one case in which this happens after a dude recovers the lost helmet of a previous Mandalore. Sort of fits that the Boba Fett, the &quot;last of the Mandalorians&quot; would become an &quot;inherited&quot; name as well.</div> </div> </div> </div>If you're getting into EU, Mandalore is a title. IIRC it literally means Leader. That's why there's a title after the fact, Mandalore the Destroyer, Mandalore the Rebuilder, Manalore the Eternal.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Odd_Canuck is not a topical medication or food product and is not to be taken internally or seriously.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/31-odd_canuck","name":"Odd_Canuck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar31_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1474"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-20T13:41:35-08:00","id":54205,"title":"","content":"Wow, guess they expanded out the Mandalorians alot since I quit the EU. I know they did some stuff with them on Clone Wars cartoon, where they were still alive and well. But last time I was really into the EU they were long extinct...<br /> <br /> <br /> Anyway, I love the idea of someone killing Boba Fett and assuming his identity(presumably between the two trilogies), and if they do that with a Boba Fett movie then I'm in big time! Because that'd be awesome.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.