r Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-21T15:07:11-07:00","id":176453,"title":"","content":"Brick was phenomenal, I was a little let down by Looper. But good news nonetheless!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-21T20:28:40-07:00","id":176672,"title":"","content":"And it looks like this confirms that, for now at least, each movie in the trilogy will be directed by a different filmmaker. I'm uneasy about that, but it worked well enough for the OT! And if this is how they're gonna do it, then there's really no excuse not to have Joss Whedon do at least one of them!<br /> <br /> I really hope that Brad Bird is on the short list of directors for the third film...Also, Guillermo del Toro!<br /> <br /> And, of course, there's a number of folks who, while great directors, have styles that just wouldn't work with SW...Can you imagine if Tim Burton, David Lynch, or Paul Verhoeven got to direct one of them? <br /> <br /> OTOH, I'd *love* to see a one-off SW movie by Wes Anderson...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","name":"Hand-of-Omega","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar681_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2747"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-22T07:46:50-07:00","id":176988,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hand-of-Omega</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/2645-star-wars-new-movies?p=176194#post176194\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Still, I'd like to learn more about the Techno Union from ep II...</div> </div> </div> </div>I wish they'd just done a good job of explaining the politics and the different political groups...<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hand-of-Omega</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/2645-star-wars-new-movies?p=176672#post176672\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And it looks like this confirms that, for now at least, each movie in the trilogy will be directed by a different filmmaker. I'm uneasy about that, but it worked well enough for the OT! And if this is how they're gonna do it, then there's really no excuse not to have Joss Whedon do at least one of them!<br /> <br /> I really hope that Brad Bird is on the short list of directors for the third film...Also, Guillermo del Toro!<br /> <br /> And, of course, there's a number of folks who, while great directors, have styles that just wouldn't work with SW...Can you imagine if Tim Burton, David Lynch, or Paul Verhoeven got to direct one of them?<br /> <br /> OTOH, I'd *love* to see a one-off SW movie by Wes Anderson...</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh yea, they could get Whedon, Brad Bird or Wes Anderson to do a Star Wars movie, that'd be amazing!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-24T09:38:17-07:00","id":178986,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hand-of-Omega</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/2645-star-wars-new-movies?p=176672#post176672\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And it looks like this confirms that, for now at least, each movie in the trilogy will be directed by a different filmmaker. I'm uneasy about that, but it worked well enough for the OT! And if this is how they're gonna do it, then there's really no excuse not to have Joss Whedon do at least one of them!<br /> <br /> I really hope that Brad Bird is on the short list of directors for the third film...Also, Guillermo del Toro!<br /> <br /> And, of course, there's a number of folks who, while great directors, have styles that just wouldn't work with SW...Can you imagine if Tim Burton, David Lynch, or Paul Verhoeven got to direct one of them?<br /> <br /> OTOH, I'd *love* to see a one-off SW movie by Wes Anderson...</div> </div> </div> </div>There are a lot of great directors, but I don't think that they would nesscarily make a great Star Wars film. Guillermo del Toro is one of those. Just like I like Abrams a lot, but could live forever without ever seeing another Star Trek film directed by him. With a few exceptions (Spielberg to name one) I would say the best directors don't trancend their niches(vs generas) well, They are good at what they do because of both their experience and their passion for it. Taking them outside of that(even when they have a passion for it) is when you get crappy movies.<br /> <br /> Or maybe you would say Spielberg's niche is epic. No matter the genera whether it be Sci-Fi, Fantasy, Historical if the story lends to something that can be epic he will make it so.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forever and always forward.<br /> Don't ask why that came to mind or that I felt the need to post it.<br /> I see the incorporeally challenged.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/787-sorwen","name":"Sorwen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"228"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-24T16:17:22-07:00","id":179313,"title":"","content":"Looks like the movies hit a slight snag with Harrison Ford's injury: <a href=\"http://io9.com/harrison-fords-injury-may-have-completely-screwed-up-ep-1594838394\" target=\"_blank\">http://io9.com/harrison-fords-injury...-ep-1594838394</a><br /> <br /> <br /> Wonder what they'll do?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-24T19:53:35-07:00","id":179423,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr Gone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/2645-star-wars-new-movies?p=179313#post179313\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Looks like the movies hit a slight snag with Harrison Ford's injury: <a href=\"http://io9.com/harrison-fords-injury-may-have-completely-screwed-up-ep-1594838394\" target=\"_blank\">http://io9.com/harrison-fords-injury...-ep-1594838394</a><br /> <br /> <br /> Wonder what they'll do?</div> </div> </div> </div>A: use a body double.<br /> B: rewrite scenes so he's sitting<br /> C: give him a high tech looking prop cast and have the character take an injury early in the events of the movie, preferably by being heroic.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Odd_Canuck is not a topical medication or food product and is not to be taken internally or seriously.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/31-odd_canuck","name":"Odd_Canuck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar31_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1474"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-25T00:24:10-07:00","id":179518,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Odd_Canuck</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/2645-star-wars-new-movies?p=179423#post179423\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A: use a body double.<br /> B: rewrite scenes so he's sitting<br /> C: give him a high tech looking prop cast and have the character take an injury early in the events of the movie, preferably by being heroic.</div> </div> </div> </div>I imagine it will be a combination of A and B. Rewrite some scenes that were already lower-key so that they don't require him to walk, rejigger the filming schedule to put off as many of the more strenuous scenes as possible for as long as possible, and for any that need to be filmed before he's recovered, use a double. That, or push back the release date, which would honestly be my preferred option, but I don't expect that to happen.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-25T07:55:48-07:00","id":179708,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Odd_Canuck</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/2645-star-wars-new-movies?p=179423#post179423\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A: use a body double.<br /> B: rewrite scenes so he's sitting<br /> C: give him a high tech looking prop cast and have the character take an injury early in the events of the movie, preferably by being heroic.</div> </div> </div> </div>D: Have Jeff Bridges play the role and CGI Harrison ford's face over it from the old movies, because that worked in Tron, right? [/sarcasm]<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-25T10:10:55-07:00","id":179824,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr Gone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/2645-star-wars-new-movies?p=179313#post179313\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Looks like the movies hit a slight snag with Harrison Ford's injury: <a href=\"http://io9.com/harrison-fords-injury-may-have-completely-screwed-up-ep-1594838394\" target=\"_blank\">http://io9.com/harrison-fords-injury...-ep-1594838394</a><br /> <br /> <br /> Wonder what they'll do?</div> </div> </div> </div>See, this is one of the main reasons I didn't want those guys back. And it's not like he was even doing stunt work, was he, just walking across the set or something? <br /> <br /> BTW, just how in the HELL is Han &quot;the main character&quot; of this?! When you've got LUKE right there?? Sure, he's a much bigger star, but that shouldn't affect the script to this extent! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/confused.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Confused\" smilieid=\"10\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Ugh, just...ugh. Hopes...rapidly...dwindling...<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","name":"Hand-of-Omega","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar681_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2747"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-25T10:12:51-07:00","id":179826,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sorwen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/2645-star-wars-new-movies?p=178986#post178986\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There are a lot of great directors, but I don't think that they would nesscarily make a great Star Wars film. Guillermo del Toro is one of those. Just like I like Abrams a lot, but could live forever without ever seeing another Star Trek film directed by him. With a few exceptions (Spielberg to name one) I would say the best directors don't trancend their niches(vs generas) well, They are good at what they do because of both their experience and their passion for it. Taking them outside of that(even when they have a passion for it) is when you get crappy movies.<br /> <br /> Or maybe you would say Spielberg's niche is epic. No matter the genera whether it be Sci-Fi, Fantasy, Historical if the story lends to something that can be epic he will make it so.</div> </div> </div> </div>Still trying to imagine Tarantino or Rodriguez being set loose on SW...<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Funny, Spielberg didn't occur to me. I've always wanted to find that parallel world where he got to direct Return of the Jedi, like he was supposed to do! Maybe now is his chance to finally helm a SW flick...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","name":"Hand-of-Omega","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar681_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2747"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-25T10:15:51-07:00","id":179828,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr Gone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/2645-star-wars-new-movies?p=176988#post176988\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I wish they'd just done a good job of explaining the politics and the different political groups...</div> </div> </div> </div>Everything we were saying about the actual mechanics of the science and tech of SW, also applies to it's politics and economics: They're just set dressing to add flavor to the fable's story of Good vs. Evil. So, it's fine as it was. Frankly, it would have been distracting if they'd realistically gone into it in more detail (a flaw the Clone Wars cartoon sometimes fell into).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","name":"Hand-of-Omega","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar681_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2747"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-25T17:30:34-07:00","id":180220,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hand-of-Omega</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/2645-star-wars-new-movies?p=179828#post179828\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Everything we were saying about the actual mechanics of the science and tech of SW, also applies to it's politics and economics: They're just set dressing to add flavor to the fable's story of Good vs. Evil. So, it's fine as it was. Frankly, it would have been distracting if they'd realistically gone into it in more detail (a flaw the Clone Wars cartoon sometimes fell into).</div> </div> </div> </div>I might argue that the prequels weren't simply Good vs Evil, since the sides were pretty ill defined. Plus, for a political story, I'd expect the politics to follow some logic and reason. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-25T17:31:41-07:00","id":180221,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hand-of-Omega</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/2645-star-wars-new-movies?p=179824#post179824\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">BTW, just how in the HELL is Han &quot;the main character&quot; of this?! When you've got LUKE right there?? Sure, he's a much bigger star, but that shouldn't affect the script to this extent! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/confused.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Confused\" smilieid=\"10\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Yea, I thought that was alittle strange myself...<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-25T20:33:03-07:00","id":180308,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/2645-star-wars-new-movies?p=179708#post179708\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">D: Have Jeff Bridges play the role and CGI Harrison ford's face over it from the old movies, because that worked in Tron, right? [/sarcasm]<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>FWIW, the de-aging CGI <i>did</i> work in <i>Tron: Legacy</i>. If only they had de-aged the voice, too (Jeff Bridges\u2019 voice got deeper as he got older), the illusion would have been complete. Ah well; it was a fun experiment that <i>almost</i> worked; and next time they need an actor to play a younger version of himself, they\u2019ll know what they have to do.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-26T07:16:55-07:00","id":180784,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hand-of-Omega</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/2645-star-wars-new-movies?p=179826#post179826\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Still trying to imagine Tarantino or Rodriguez being set loose on SW...<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Funny, Spielberg didn't occur to me. I've always wanted to find that parallel world where he got to direct Return of the Jedi, like he was supposed to do! Maybe now is his chance to finally helm a SW flick...</div> </div> </div> </div>In my head, I can see the Cantina Scene as directed by Tarantino. It's <i>really good.</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/233-daydreamer","name":"Daydreamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar233_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"193"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-26T17:33:22-07:00","id":181467,"title":"","content":"Likewise with the infiltration of Jabba\u2019s fortress in <i>Return of the Jedi</i>. At the very least, Tarantino couldn\u2019t do worse than Lucas\u2019 song-and-dance patch-job. Though admittedly that\u2019s damning with faint praise\u2026","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-29T08:53:28-07:00","id":183847,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Daydreamer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/2645-star-wars-new-movies?p=180784#post180784\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> In my head, I can see the Cantina Scene as directed by Tarantino. It's <i>really good.</i></div> </div> </div> </div>Also, <i>really long</i> and talky! With Sam Jackson as the barkeep.<br /> <br /> ...and Han shoots first, but only because the blaster goes off by itself!<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","name":"Hand-of-Omega","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar681_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2747"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-29T10:16:35-07:00","id":183874,"title":"","content":"Nah, I see Greedo yelling at Han &quot;Does Jabba look like a bitch?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Ortam + Malkavia makes a Requiem fun.<br /> <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Posts in this colour are Persuasion.</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#800080\">Posts in this colour are Seduction.</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#00FF00\">Posts in this colour are Intimidation.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/57-solomon-birch","name":"solomon birch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar57_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"289"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-02T13:57:32-07:00","id":186498,"title":"","content":"That'd be awesome! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-03T10:30:45-07:00","id":187238,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>solomon birch</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/2645-star-wars-new-movies?p=183874#post183874\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Nah, I see Greedo yelling at Han &quot;Does Jabba look like a bitch?&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>No, first he asks that politely. When Han says of course not, THEN Greedo yells it. Han explains to Luke and Obi-Wan why Greedo has suddenly interrupted their conversation about transport to Alderaan. The conversation becomes more and more tense until Greedo reveals that he's brought friends who are at that moment sitting at the surrounding tables, so everybody better come with him. Quietly. And then VIOLENCE! Han shoots first, of course, <i>deliberately</i>. It's all done in one continuous, 20-minute shot.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/233-daydreamer","name":"Daydreamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar233_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"193"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-03T12:37:07-07:00","id":187314,"title":"","content":"<div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Greedo: &quot;What planet you from?&quot;<br /> Han: &quot;What?&quot;<br /> G: &quot;Hutt?&quot;<br /> H: &quot;No, I said what?&quot;<br /> G: &quot;What ain't no planet I ever heard of they speak Basic on What?&quot;<br /> H: &quot;What?&quot;<br /> G: &quot;BASIC MOTHERFUCKER DO YOU SPEAK IT?&quot;</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Ortam + Malkavia makes a Requiem fun.<br /> <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Posts in this colour are Persuasion.</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#800080\">Posts in this colour are Seduction.</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#00FF00\">Posts in this colour are Intimidation.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/57-solomon-birch","name":"solomon birch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar57_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"289"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-03T21:45:45-07:00","id":187709,"title":"","content":"I'm sorry, I'm still lost on the notion of Sam Jackson as the barkeep:<br /> <br /> &quot;We don't want no <i>motherfuckin' Droids in 