.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-23T17:11:55-07:00","id":206694,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/2645-star-wars-new-movies?p=205951#post205951\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">To clarify: I\u2019m sure that <i>Han Solo</i> will be one of the main characters. I\u2019ll eat Indiana Jones\u2019 hat if <i>Harrison Ford</i> is a character in the movie at all, let alone one of the main characters.<br /> <br /> Of course, if you have to explain a joke, it\u2019s DOA.<br /> <br /> (On that same note, I remember reading a story once where William Shatner, Leonard Nimoy, and Deforrest Kelly ended up on the bridge of the Enterprise, having been swapped with Captain Kirk, Mister Spock, and Dr. McCoy by a transporter accident along the lines of the one from \u201cMirror, Mirror\u201d. It was fun. It was also a companion piece to a story that I <i>didn\u2019t</i> get to read where Kirk, Spock, and McCoy ended up on the sound stage for <i>Star Trek</i>.)</div> </div> </div> </div>Oooooooohhh...sorry. Was having a morning. :P<br /> <br /> But, Han Solo, Indiana Jones, Harrison Ford...same difference, right? :P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"h