{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-06T07:12:40-07:00","id":220129,"title":"","content":"Just saw Guardians of the Galaxy. Funny how people keep calling it the &quot;modern Star Wars&quot;...since there's a certain movie coming out in about a year that has a better claim to that title!<br /> <br /> I did see Guardians in 3D. With so many big genre releases being made that way, it's almost certain that the new SW will also have a 3D release, but I haven't heard anything about it...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","name":"Hand-of-Omega","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar681_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2747"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-20T09:34:30-07:00","id":235487,"title":"","content":"Glad to know that I'm not the only one to have an <a href=\"http://indierevolver.com/2014/07/27/unpopular-opinion-adam-glass-on-the-prequel-trilogy/\" target=\"_blank\">Unpopular Opinion</a>...<br /> <br /> Not sure about the latest rumors on the new SW movies: Apparently, the villains are Inquisitors and will tie in to the SW: Rebels cartoon in some way. They seem to be adamant that these are NOT Sith! Of course, they wear black robes, have red eyes, and use red lightsabers, but they are &quot;Jedi Hunters&quot;, and totally not Sith, honestly! Hmmm...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","name":"Hand-of-Omega","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar681_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2747"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-20T13:17:00-07:00","id":235708,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hand-of-Omega</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/2645-star-wars-new-movies?p=235487#post235487\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Glad to know that I'm not the only one to have an <a href=\"http://indierevolver.com/2014/07/27/unpopular-opinion-adam-glass-on-the-prequel-trilogy/\" target=\"_blank\">Unpopular Opinion</a>...<br /> <br /> Not sure about the latest rumors on the new SW movies: Apparently, the villains are Inquisitors and will tie in to the SW: Rebels cartoon in some way. They seem to be adamant that these are NOT Sith! Of course, they wear black robes, have red eyes, and use red lightsabers, but they are &quot;Jedi Hunters&quot;, and totally not Sith, honestly! Hmmm...</div> </div> </div> </div>If they are going by the original use of the term in EU then it is basically like how any of the Emperor's Hands that used the force were not Sith. All the Inquisitors were force users, but the only training was to perform their role. It is the splitting hair difference between being trained <b>by</b> a Sith and being trained <b>as</b> a Sith. You don't get as cool of a title.<br /> <br /> Side note: I'm still hating the forum software taking over my right click. I'm tried of things telling me how I want to use what I use.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forever and always forward.<br /> Don't ask why that came to mind or that I felt the need to post it.<br /> I see the incorporeally challenged.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactio