-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AnubisXy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/2645-star-wars-new-movies?p=488202#post488202\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I used to be a huge Star Wars fan (I was one of those guys who camped out for 3 days to get into the first showing of Episode 1). But my interest in the franchise has really waned over the years. due to a lot of substandard garbage (I think KotOR 2 was the last Star Wars related thing I actually enjoyed). Anyway, I was rather surprised that I didn't feel anything at all while watching this trailer.<br /> <br /> Well, I'll go see it and hopefully it will be able to rekindle my feelings.</div> </div> </div> </div>I feel you. I used to love all things Star Wars, then that love cooled at the same time, and for the same reasons, that I lost interest in JRPGs. I didn't leave the franchise entirely, though, because Aaron Alston's Wraith Squadron books are freaking awesome.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/233-daydreamer","name":"Daydreamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar233_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"193"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-24T14:36:27-07:00","id":490930,"title":"","content":"Useless trivia for the day, my screenname is a Star Wars reference (the grey Jedi), inspired by the first KOTOR and Jolee Bindo. The next set of movies look good so far, here's hoping for a good and less dense set up than we got from EPS 1-3. I had to go back and watch those three a couple of times to pick up a bunch of things I missed going on in the background. There was too much going on at some points, like Lucas was cramming in everything he could think of.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b>Onyx Path Forum Administrator</b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><b><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">Posts in this color are moderator posts</span></b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\"><span style=\"color:#00FF00\">Posts in this color mean a Great Old One has driven me mad.</span></span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11-darksider","name":"Darksider","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11_2.jpeg","title":"Forum Administrator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1692"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-24T15:40:59-07:00","id":491004,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Darksider</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/2645-star-wars-new-movies?p=490930#post490930\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The next set of movies look good so far, here's hoping for a good and less dense set up than we got from EPS 1-3. I had to go back and watch those three a couple of times to pick up a bunch of things I missed going on in the background. There was too much going on at some points, like Lucas was cramming in everything he could think of.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yea, I'm hoping for some a little closer to the OT, something that will take it's time and not cram everything it can into every scene. Doesn't look that way from the trailers, so I have some hope. Plus, J.J. Abrams is a big SW fan, so I think that'll help too...<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-24T18:37:36-07:00","id":491141,"title":"","content":"I just hope he's gotten over his fascination with lens flare, especially if there will be parts on Tatooine.<br /> <br /> I was just thinking about it, Lucas did have a skill for naming his planets, I like all of them (even Dantooine, the worst of the names).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <span style=\"font-