serid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2034-jaytee","name":"JayTee","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2034_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1805"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-20T00:11:25-07:00","id":710099,"title":"","content":"Ok, here we go! Hope this gives you more to go on, JayTee!<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sGbxmsDFVnE\" data-code=\"sGbxmsDFVnE\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/sGbxmsDFVnE/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","name":"Hand-of-Omega","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar681_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2747"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-20T09:51:20-07:00","id":710800,"title":"","content":"That trailer was actually the one that inspired that post, but in the interest of fair play I'll watch it again and tell you my impressions.<br /> <br /> 1: Scavenger girl (I assume female lead) is having doubts about herself.<br /> <br /> 2: Storm Trooper guy (I assume male lead) is having an existential crisis about his place in the universe.<br /> <br /> 3: Evil Darth Vader fanboy guy (I assume main villain) makes evil speech, wants to &quot;finish what you started&quot;, no idea what thing he's talking about. Assuming it's the Jedi Purge.<br /> <br /> 4: Fanservice shots featuring the old cast meeting the new cast, talking about the past movies.<br /> <br /> 5: Fight scene shots, evil guy poses evilly, Storm Trooper guy is (I assume) wondering why he's being accepted in to the (I assume) the new rebel alliance.<br /> <br /> 6: Han Solo and (I assume) Liea voice over talking about the force and the Jedi.<br /> <br /> 7: More flashy fight scenes, finally an actual shot of Liea.<br /> <br /> 8: Storm trooper guy is apparently using a lightsaber. I assume he's the new chosen one. Nice that they have the balls to make a black male lead.<br /> <br /> Beyond that (which includes a lot of assumptions), I don't feel I know any of these characters. I don't even know what the premise of the movie is beyond &quot;Yo dawg, the force is back and people may or may not become jedi&quot; &quot;Oh, and the old cast you love is back too, fan service for everyone!&quot;<br /> <br /> I admit I'm being a little cynical, but after the last trio of star wars movies, I feel a little cynicism is warranted.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2034-jaytee","name":"JayTee","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2034_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1805"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-20T15:41:46-07:00","id":711367,"title":"","content":"I actually like they didn't give much away in terms of plot for the new movie. I sometimes think trailers give way too much away. This one didn't. It showed me enough to get me interested and excited, but thats about it.<br /> <br /> I can't wait for December 18th!!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-20T16:52:33-07:00","id":711444,"title":"","content":"I can get that, but at the same time I'd also like to at least get the &quot;back of the book&quot; summery of what the basic premise is so I can get more involved.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2034-jaytee","name":"JayTee","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2034_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1805"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-20T17:05:36-07:00","id":711457,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JayTee</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/foru