mmediately killing himself, so he's <i>got</i> to have at least some sensitivity to the Force.<br /> <br /> I'm genuinely surprised they haven't pulled the trigger on Rey's parentage backstory yet. I figured she must a Solo, but maybe she's a Skywalker? Hm.<br /> <br /> Anyway, she's pretty cool.<br /> <br /> I hope they dig into Poe a little more in the sequels; he's a cool guy too.<br /> <br /> BB-88 is <i>adorable</i>. I want one!</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm feeling bluuuueeeee~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","name":"Prometheus878","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar175_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1477"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-19T12:55:37-08:00","id":789383,"title":"","content":"Yeah, I found the movie to be AMAZING! Sure, give me some time and, like any geek, I could find plenty of flaws to complain about, but there is really nothing actually substantial that I didn't like. It mostly surpassed my expectations and is among my all time favorite anything related to Star Wars<br /> <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show';