new how to fly a ship because she's familiar with the tech and agile and honestly she waemsn't that good at first, she smashed up stuff till she got a handle on it.<br /> <br /> And as for Rey getting some jedi skills, her skills were very basic and she got them thanks to Kylo, when he connected his mind to hers she resisted long enough to see what he was doing and then reverse it and suck the basic jedi knowledge from him.<br /> <br /> Its like the jedi equivilant of a cheat sheet.<br /> <br /> And Rey is by no means a jedi master, she fights more like a raging barbarian, especially before she brain sucks him for the second time.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-04T09:11:00-07:00","id":881880,"title":"","content":"Thought I'd put this here:<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>MAY THE 4TH BE WITH YOU!</b></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-04T21:06:37-07:00","id":882517,"title":"","content":"Happy 4th! [looks at clo